OL,3,GNEWSAExplosives team called to rail
OL,4,Aline as trains disrupted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers are facing disruption after
OL,7,Ftrains were cancelled when an object
OL,8,Fsuspected to be unexploded ordnance was
OL,9,Ffound near a rail line.
OL,11,FGreater Anglia trains between Norwich
OL,12,Fand Ely, including those running to
OL,13,FStansted Airport via Cambridge, were
OL,14,Fcancelled before services were later
OL,15,Fresumed, although delays and changes
OL,16,Fare expected until 15:15 BST.
OL,18,FNorfolk Police was called at 09:52
OL,19,Fafter workers found the suspicious
OL,20,Fobject near Thetford. An Army explosive
OL,21,Fordnance disposal team has been called
OL,22,Fto the scene.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
