OL,3,GNEWSAExplosives team called to rail
OL,4,Aline as trains disrupted
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The line has now reopened, services
OL,7,Fwill begin to return to normal,"
OL,8,FGreater Anglia said, adding: "Some
OL,9,Fdelays and alterations may be present
OL,10,Fwhilst the service recovers."
